                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14394884" author="iveselovskiy" created="Fri, 3 Apr 2015 18:39:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;patch is tested on Ubuntu with debian BigTop Ignite distribution.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14394933" author="cos" created="Fri, 3 Apr 2015 19:02:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks like a potential fix for multi-tenancy issue and &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-218&quot; title=&quot;Wrong staging permissions while running MR job under hadoop accelerator&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-218&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-218&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;??&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14395179" author="iveselovskiy" created="Fri, 3 Apr 2015 22:29:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;No, this fix will not help for 218. For 218 we now have a config option &amp;#8211; this is described in a bottom comment to IG-218.&lt;br/&gt;
This bug (IG-679) can be worked around as described above or just by using TCP socket communication protocol. Shmem is faster, so in some cases it is preferrable over TCP.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14481141" author="iveselovskiy" created="Mon, 6 Apr 2015 11:15:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patch &quot;b&quot; provides lazy temp directory creation.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14483028" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 7 Apr 2015 11:17:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Two problems here:&lt;br/&gt;
1) getUserSpecificTempDir() throws RuntimeException. But only IgniteCheckedException should be thrown from doLoad() method.&lt;br/&gt;
2) getUserSpecificTempDir() executes multiple times, while it is enough to execute it only once and pass File instance to extractAndLoad() method.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
